# ── Mode ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# With nothing set, the machine runs in DEMO mode: a local mock wallet, a
# localStorage pool, in-browser rolls. Fully usable, zero secrets.
# Set the groups below one at a time to go live. Copy to .env.local first.

# ── API sandbox ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GACHA_SANDBOX=1 serves the whole v1 API (odds, pulls, settle, buyback,
# ship, inventory, webhooks) from memory: the default machine from
# lib/config.ts, the seed pool, no chain, no database, no Privy. Player
# auth is `Authorization: Bearer sandbox:<wallet>`; the operator key is
# GACHA_SANDBOX_OPERATOR_KEY (default gk_sandbox_operator). This is how a
# storefront is built against the API before any live group is set.
GACHA_SANDBOX=
GACHA_SANDBOX_OPERATOR_KEY=
# Where the built-in storefront finds the API. Defaults to /api/v1 (same
# origin). Point it at a hosted machine to run this UI as a client only.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GACHA_API_BASE=

# ── Wallet / auth (Privy) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Client: switches the header from the demo wallet to Privy login with an
# embedded Solana wallet.
NEXT_PUBLIC_PRIVY_APP_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_PRIVY_CLIENT_ID=
# Server: lets the money routes verify the player's access token. Never
# exposed to the client.
PRIVY_APP_SECRET=

# ── Ledger (Supabase, server-only) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Run docs/schema.sql once. RLS is on with no policies, so only the service
# role key can read or write. The admin pages and the live pull routes use it.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# Back-of-house password for /admin (sent as the x-admin-key header). The
# admin pages operate ADMIN_MACHINE_ID (default: the machine seeded from
# lib/config.ts by `bun scripts/seed-machine.ts`).
ADMIN_PASSWORD=
ADMIN_MACHINE_ID=

# ── On-chain settlement (server-only) ────────────────────────────────────
# Required for live pull and buyback settlement. See docs/ONCHAIN_SPEC.md.
SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com
THRIFT_PROGRAM_ID=                 # from `anchor keys list` after build/deploy
USDC_MINT=4zMMC9srt5Ri5X14GAgXhaHii3GnPAEERYPJgZJDncDU  # devnet USDC (mainnet: EPjFWdd5AufqSSqeM2qN1xzybapC8G4wEGGkZwyTDt1v)

# Relayer = fee payer for every tx (players hold no SOL). JSON array or base64.
RELAYER_SECRET_KEY=
# Payout authority = the ONLY key allowed to sign buybacks. Keep separate from
# the program admin (cold) key. Rotate regularly.
PAYOUT_AUTHORITY_SECRET_KEY=

# The course fee recipient is not an env var on purpose. It lives in
# lib/course-fee.ts and is a default the course relies on.

# ── Coinbase Onramp (server-only) ────────────────────────────────────────
# CDP API key from https://portal.cdp.coinbase.com, used to mint single-use
# Onramp session tokens. Never expose these to the client.
CDP_API_KEY_ID=
CDP_API_KEY_SECRET=
